        <mxCell id="2" value="Overview" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1a1a2e;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2b714;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="320" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3" value="Structure SSoT for surfaces, flows, and rule attachments across platforms. Rule
wording lives in specs/domain-*.md and business-rules.md." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=11;fontColor=#666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="24" width="480" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4" value="App shell
[any]
/*" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#16213e;fontColor=#e8e8e8;strokeColor=#0f9b8e;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="100" width="220" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5" value="DBR-PUR-001 — DBR-PUR-001 The system’s primary
job is **Build composition**: assemble and
maintain Destiny 2 builds from sets,
synergies, and variants." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#43a047;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="100" width="300" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="6" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="4" target="5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7" value="DBR-PUR-002 — DBR-PUR-002 Inventory
organization, theorycraft discovery, and hunt
planning are supporting capabilities, not the
primary job." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#43a047;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="166" width="300" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="4" target="7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="9" value="DBR-PUR-003 — DBR-PUR-003 Primary success
journey: **intent → compose → equip**.
Secondary: **curate a reusable library** of
sets and synergies." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#43a047;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="232" width="300" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="10" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="4" target="9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="11" value="BR-AUTH-001 — BR-AUTH-001 Sets, Synergies,
Builds APIs require authenticated user." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#1e88e5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="298" width="300" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
