masterwork, crafted/enhanced plugs as
applicable) — not an instance id." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#43a047;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="350" y="4448" width="300" height="69" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
