        <mxCell id="144" value="009:SC-001 — 009-description-search SC-001
Users can find a perk by an effect keyword
that appears only in its description (not its
name) in under 30 seconds using picker search
alone." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e5f5;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#8e24aa;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="6505" width="300" height="69" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
