        <mxCell id="149" value="003:SC-004 — 003-owned-inventory-instances
SC-004 A user can identify which owned copy
has two specified perks (for example, by name)
without using an external inventory manager,
in under 30 seconds for items with fewer than
10 copies." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e5f5;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#8e24aa;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="350" y="6720" width="300" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="150" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="146" target="149"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="151" value="010:SC-001 — 010-instance-disambiguation
SC-001 Given several owned copies of the same
item (e.g. five copies), a user can identify
and select the correct copy for a set in under
60 seconds without an external inventory tool." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e5f5;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#8e24aa;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="350" y="6808" width="300" height="69" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="152" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="146" target="151"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="153" value="Owned instance card" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#222831;fontColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#00adb5;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="120" y="6913" width="220" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="154" value="BR-CAT-006 — BR-CAT-006 Multi-value facets
support **include OR within dimension**, **AND
across dimensions**, and **exclude** (any
exclude match drops). Free-text further ANDs.
Affirmed by
[DBR-ROLL-010](./domain-business-rules.md)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#1e88e5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="6913" width="300" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="155" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="153" target="154"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="156" value="010:SC-001 — 010-instance-disambiguation
SC-001 Given several owned copies of the same
item (e.g. five copies), a user can identify
and select the correct copy for a set in under
60 seconds without an external inventory tool." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e5f5;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#8e24aa;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="7001" width="300" height="69" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="157" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="153" target="156"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="158" value="011:SC-001 — 011-per-copy-perk-grid SC-001 For
a selected weapon copy, 100% of the copy&apos;s
perk columns display the perks that copy can
actually slot (equipped plus alternates),
verified against both a crafted/multi-perk
example and a static-roll example." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e5f5;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#8e24aa;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="7078" width="300" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="159" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="153" target="158"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="160" value="Per-copy perk grid" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1b262c;fontColor=#bbe1fa;strokeColor=#3282b8;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="160" y="7194" width="220" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="161" value="011:SC-001 — 011-per-copy-perk-grid SC-001 For
a selected weapon copy, 100% of the copy&apos;s
perk columns display the perks that copy can
actually slot (equipped plus alternates),
verified against both a crafted/multi-perk
example and a static-roll example." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e5f5;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#8e24aa;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="7194" width="300" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="162" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="160" target="161"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="163" value="011:SC-002 — 011-per-copy-perk-grid SC-002 Two
copies of the same weapon with different rolls
produce visibly different grids in 100% of
verification cases." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e5f5;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#8e24aa;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="7282" width="300" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="164" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="160" target="163"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="165" value="BR-ROLL-002 — BR-ROLL-002 Removed SetItems
retain roll history for display (soft-remove)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#1e88e5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="7348" width="300" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="166" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="160" target="165"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="167" value="DAC (acceptance)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8e7;fontColor=#333;strokeColor=#e2b714;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="7440" width="140" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="168" value="DBR (domain BR)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#43a047;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="190" y="7440" width="140" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="169" value="BR (feature BR)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#1e88e5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="7440" width="140" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="170" value="Slice AC/SC" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e5f5;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#8e24aa;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="490" y="7440" width="140" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
