        <mxCell id="66" value="DBR-STAT-008 — DBR-STAT-008 **Armor Set**
piece/board stats are the piece **base roll**
(sum of `armor_stats` plug investments).
Equipped armor mods, masterwork, and tuning
are excluded from that board. Full-loadout
soft-target coverage still follows
DBR-STAT-005." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#43a047;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="2109" width="300" height="91" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
