exotic slot that has 3 or more distinct
exotics represented across the user&apos;s
loadouts, at least 2 different specific
exotics appear in the results list. When using
exact-specific filter for a popular exotic,
only matching loadouts appear." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e5f5;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#8e24aa;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="350" y="667" width="300" height="102" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
