        <mxCell id="20" value="003:SC-005 — 003-owned-inventory-instances
SC-005 Unauthenticated or never-synced users
receive a clear, actionable response (auth
error or sync prompt) with zero instance data
leaked in 100% of unauthorized or empty-state
test cases." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e5f5;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#8e24aa;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="494" width="300" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="21" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="17" target="20"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="22" value="Settings
[signed-out]
/settings
📷 settings-signed-out" style="shape=rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2d4059;fontColor=#fff;strokeColor=#ea5455;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="610" width="220" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="23" value="BR-AUTH-001 — BR-AUTH-001 Sets, Synergies,
Builds APIs require authenticated user." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#1e88e5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="610" width="300" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="24" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="22" target="23"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="25" value="Catalog weapons (public)
[signed-out]
/catalog
📷 catalog-signed-out-weapons" style="shape=rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2d4059;fontColor=#fff;strokeColor=#ea5455;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="706" width="220" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="26" value="DAC-NME-003 — Catalog multi-facet browse
**Given** a user browsing weapons or armor in
Catalog (including set-fill constrained pick)
**When** they combine free-text with
multi-value facets (e.g. element, ammo,
archetype) including include and exclude
**Then** results respect OR-within-facet,
AND-across-facets, and exclude-drop semantics
**And** optional group-by dimensions partition
the result list without changing filter
semantics" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8e7;fontColor=#333;strokeColor=#e2b714;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="706" width="300" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="27" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="25" target="26"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="28" value="DBR-ROLL-010 — DBR-ROLL-010 Catalog **browse**
for composition supports multi-dimension
filtering (e.g. element, ammo,
archetype/frame, slot, class, exotic
constraint, free-text, optional synergy
membership) with **include OR within a
facet**, **AND across facets**, and
**exclude** drops; optional **group-by** one
or more dimensions for browse. Catalog is a
composition aid, not a separate product job
(see DBR-PUR-002)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#43a047;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="849" width="300" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="29" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="25" target="28"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="30" value="BR-CAT-001 — BR-CAT-001 Fast filter/search for
full weapon catalog (manifest)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#1e88e5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="992" width="300" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="31" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="25" target="30"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="32" value="DBR-PUR-002 — DBR-PUR-002 Inventory
organization, theorycraft discovery, and hunt
planning are supporting capabilities, not the
primary job." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#43a047;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="1036" width="300" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="33" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="25" target="32"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="34" value="DAC (acceptance)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8e7;fontColor=#333;strokeColor=#e2b714;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1150" width="140" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="35" value="DBR (domain BR)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#43a047;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="190" y="1150" width="140" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="36" value="BR (feature BR)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#1e88e5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="1150" width="140" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="37" value="Slice AC/SC" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e5f5;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#8e24aa;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="490" y="1150" width="140" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
