        <mxCell id="7" value="DBR-BLD-003 — DBR-BLD-003 Exactly one
**default variant** per build." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#43a047;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="155" width="300" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="4" target="7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="9" value="BR-BLD-006 — BR-BLD-006 Exactly one default
variant per build." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#1e88e5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="199" width="300" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="10" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="4" target="9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="11" value="Armor → Reuse
[signed-in]
/build
📷 build-edit-armor-reuse" style="shape=rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2d4059;fontColor=#fff;strokeColor=#ea5455;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="271" width="220" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="12" value="BR-ATT-001 — BR-ATT-001 Users attach one or
more Sets to a Build variant." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#1e88e5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="271" width="300" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="13" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="11" target="12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="14" value="BR-ATT-002 — BR-ATT-002 Attachment mode:
**live** (default) or **snapshot**, per
variant." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#1e88e5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="315" width="300" height="47" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="15" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="11" target="14"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="16" value="DBR-CMP-003 — DBR-CMP-003 Set attachments
default to **live**; user may snapshot for a
frozen equipable variant." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#43a047;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="370" width="300" height="47" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="17" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="11" target="16"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="18" value="Armor → Create
[signed-in]
/build
📷 build-edit-armor-create" style="shape=rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2d4059;fontColor=#fff;strokeColor=#ea5455;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="453" width="220" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="19" value="DAC-P2-005 — In-flow create still works
**Given** a thin library **When** the user
composes a build **Then** they can create
needed synergies/sets during compose without a
hard library gate --- ## Variants &amp; identity" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8e7;fontColor=#333;strokeColor=#e2b714;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="453" width="300" height="69" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="20" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="18" target="19"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="21" value="DBR-PUR-004 — DBR-PUR-004 Users may create
synergies and sets **in-flow** during compose;
a deep library is not a hard gate to start
composing." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#43a047;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="530" width="300" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="22" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="18" target="21"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="23" value="BR-BLD-007 — BR-BLD-007 Production Builds
provides a **guided finish walkthrough**
(Armor → Weapons → Mods): create empty Set +
live attach (replace-by-type), link existing,
capture-from-build when resolved gear exists,
fill slots from Builds; Skip for now does not
satisfy. **v1 shipped in 028.**" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#1e88e5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="596" width="300" height="91" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="24" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="18" target="23"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="25" value="BR-SET-001 — BR-SET-001 Users can create,
name, tag, edit, view, and delete Sets." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#1e88e5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="695" width="300" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
