  <diagram id="flow-flow-catalog-weapons" name="Catalog — weapons browse + detail">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="1722" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0"/>
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
        <mxCell id="2" value="Catalog — weapons browse + detail" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1a1a2e;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2b714;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="320" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3" value="Weapons kind, Owned/Manifest scopes, and item detail pane." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=11;fontColor=#666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="24" width="480" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="4" value="Signed-out Manifest weapons
[signed-out]
/catalog
📷 catalog-signed-out-weapons" style="shape=rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2d4059;fontColor=#fff;strokeColor=#ea5455;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="100" width="220" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5" value="DAC-NME-003 — Catalog multi-facet browse
**Given** a user browsing weapons or armor in
Catalog (including set-fill constrained pick)
**When** they combine free-text with
multi-value facets (e.g. element, ammo,
archetype) including include and exclude
**Then** results respect OR-within-facet,
AND-across-facets, and exclude-drop semantics
**And** optional group-by dimensions partition
the result list without changing filter
semantics" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8e7;fontColor=#333;strokeColor=#e2b714;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="100" width="300" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="6" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="4" target="5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7" value="DBR-ROLL-010 — DBR-ROLL-010 Catalog **browse**
for composition supports multi-dimension
filtering (e.g. element, ammo,
archetype/frame, slot, class, exotic
constraint, free-text, optional synergy
membership) with **include OR within a
facet**, **AND across facets**, and
**exclude** drops; optional **group-by** one
or more dimensions for browse. Catalog is a
composition aid, not a separate product job
(see DBR-PUR-002)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#43a047;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="243" width="300" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="4" target="7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="9" value="BR-CAT-001 — BR-CAT-001 Fast filter/search for
full weapon catalog (manifest)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#1e88e5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="386" width="300" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="10" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="4" target="9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="11" value="DBR-PUR-002 — DBR-PUR-002 Inventory
organization, theorycraft discovery, and hunt
planning are supporting capabilities, not the
primary job." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#43a047;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="430" width="300" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="12" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="4" target="11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="13" value="Signed-in Owned
[signed-in]
/catalog
📷 catalog-weapons-owned" style="shape=rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2d4059;fontColor=#fff;strokeColor=#ea5455;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="524" width="220" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="14" value="DAC-NME-003 — Catalog multi-facet browse
**Given** a user browsing weapons or armor in
Catalog (including set-fill constrained pick)
**When** they combine free-text with
multi-value facets (e.g. element, ammo,
archetype) including include and exclude
**Then** results respect OR-within-facet,
AND-across-facets, and exclude-drop semantics
**And** optional group-by dimensions partition
the result list without changing filter
semantics" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8e7;fontColor=#333;strokeColor=#e2b714;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="524" width="300" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="15" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="13" target="14"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="16" value="DBR-ROLL-010 — DBR-ROLL-010 Catalog **browse**
for composition supports multi-dimension
filtering (e.g. element, ammo,
archetype/frame, slot, class, exotic
constraint, free-text, optional synergy
membership) with **include OR within a
facet**, **AND across facets**, and
**exclude** drops; optional **group-by** one
or more dimensions for browse. Catalog is a
composition aid, not a separate product job
(see DBR-PUR-002)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#43a047;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="667" width="300" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="17" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="13" target="16"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="18" value="BR-CAT-001 — BR-CAT-001 Fast filter/search for
full weapon catalog (manifest)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#1e88e5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="810" width="300" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="19" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="13" target="18"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="20" value="BR-CAT-002 — BR-CAT-002 Fast filter/search for
user-owned weapons (inventory sync)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#1e88e5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="854" width="300" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="21" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="13" target="20"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="22" value="003:SC-001 — 003-owned-inventory-instances
SC-001 When a signed-in user with synced
inventory searches for a weapon they own in
multiple copies **via owned catalog by name**,
they can view each copy as a separate entry
with power, location, and perk names within
one interaction flow (catalog search → select
row → auto-fetched instance list)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e5f5;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#8e24aa;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="898" width="300" height="102" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="23" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="13" target="22"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="24" value="003:SC-002 — 003-owned-inventory-instances
SC-002 In 95% of test cases with current
manifest loaded, equipped plugs on owned
weapons display as readable perk or trait
names rather than raw identifiers only." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e5f5;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#8e24aa;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="636" y="524" width="300" height="69" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="25" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="13" target="24"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="26" value="Signed-in Manifest
[signed-in]
/catalog
📷 catalog-weapons-manifest" style="shape=rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2d4059;fontColor=#fff;strokeColor=#ea5455;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="792" width="220" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="27" value="DAC-NME-003 — Catalog multi-facet browse
**Given** a user browsing weapons or armor in
Catalog (including set-fill constrained pick)
**When** they combine free-text with
multi-value facets (e.g. element, ammo,
archetype) including include and exclude
**Then** results respect OR-within-facet,
AND-across-facets, and exclude-drop semantics
**And** optional group-by dimensions partition
the result list without changing filter
semantics" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8e7;fontColor=#333;strokeColor=#e2b714;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="792" width="300" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="28" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#bbb;dashed=1;endArrow=none;opacity=60;" edge="1" parent="1" source="26" target="27"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="29" value="DBR-ROLL-001 — DBR-ROLL-001 Planning may
reference **catalog** items and **desired
rolls** not yet owned." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#43a047;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="935" width="300" height="47" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
