[signed-in]
/catalog
📷 catalog-weapon-detail" style="shape=rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2d4059;fontColor=#fff;strokeColor=#ea5455;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1275" width="220" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="37" value="BR-CAT-006 — BR-CAT-006 Multi-value facets
support **include OR within dimension**, **AND
across dimensions**, and **exclude** (any
exclude match drops). Free-text further ANDs.
Affirmed by
[DBR-ROLL-010](./domain-business-rules.md)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#1e88e5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="1275" width="300" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
