        <mxCell id="43" value="DBR-ROLL-007 — DBR-ROLL-007 **Catalysts**:
display status only — equipped; unequipped
(warn); unfinished (warn); unacquired. Do not
gate save/equip." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;fontColor=#222;strokeColor=#43a047;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320" y="1528" width="300" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
